  "name": "2004 April-May Underway pCO 2 Data: VOS Columbus Waikato",
  "description": "Atmospheric and surface sea water pCO2 on board the VOS Columbus Waikato. Measurements taken by PMEL scientists from April 24 to May 5, 2004. Underway pCO2 data are available on-line via FTP. See http://www.pmel.noaa.gov/co2/uwpco2/uwpco2_ftp.html to gain data access via a terminal session or go directly to ftp://ftp.pmel.noaa.gov/uwpCO2/ .\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To create seasonal flux maps.",
